From 08f4030fcb0bc68363e83c15762351a25b06a80e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:44:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 084/100] MAINTAINERS: Add entries for the A133/TrimUI Smart
 Pro drivers

Add entries for the new drivers of this series: the A100/A133 PWM and GPU
power domain drivers, the OTM1289A panel, the TrimUI Smart Pro gamepad and
the xradio WLAN driver, with their bindings.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
---
 MAINTAINERS | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 28 insertions(+)

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index 782389bd5..fa4fb256d 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -866,6 +866,20 @@ T:	git git://linuxtv.org/media.git
 F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/allwinner,sun4i-a10-csi.yaml
 F:	drivers/media/platform/sunxi/sun4i-csi/
 
+ALLWINNER A100 GPU POWER DOMAIN DRIVER
