+L:	linux-sunxi@lists.linux.dev
+S:	Maintained
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/allwinner,sun50i-a100-gpu-ppu.yaml
+F:	drivers/pmdomain/sunxi/sun50i-a100-gpu-ppu.c
+
+ALLWINNER A100/A133 PWM DRIVER
+M:	leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
+L:	linux-pwm@vger.kernel.org
+S:	Maintained
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/allwinner,sun50i-a100-pwm.yaml
+F:	drivers/pwm/pwm-sun50i-a100.c
+
 ALLWINNER A31 CSI DRIVER
